cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: rescue-archiving
abstract: >-
  A local-first, human-in-the-loop pipeline for preserving at-risk media with
  verifiable provenance: capture, integrity (SHA-256) and perceptual hashing, an
  independent Wayback Machine snapshot, an append-only chain of custody, and
  portable export. Built to protect both file integrity and the people who
  contribute material.
type: software
authors:
